T1  - Can large language models reliably educate patients after kyphoplasty? A clinician-rated comparative study of ChatGPT and Gemini
AU  - Zhu, Stanley
AU  - Singh, Sanidhya
AU  - Richey, Bradley
AU  - Cuilan, Gabriel
AU  - Gong, Davin
AU  - Aleem, Ilyas
