T1  - Analyzing the dependability of Large Language Models for code clone generation
AU  - Eagal, Azeeza
AU  - Stolee, Kathryn T.
AU  - Ore, John-Paul
JO  - Journal of Systems and Software
VL  - 230
SP  - 112548
