T1  - Supply chain resilience development in the defence industry: an AI-assisted content analysis of annual reports
AU  - Aspeteg, Joakim
AU  - Holtström, Johan
AU  - Rehme, Jakob
AU  - Havemo, Emelie
JO  - Supply Chain Management: An International Journal
VL  - 31
IS  - 7
SP  - 38
